  "body_html": "<p>We are officially on week 37 of the bull market. Price action has been sideways…making many question whether we will break to the upside again, or if the market is exhausted. When the market is sideways, and doing nothing with our capital…I do nothing! </p><p>However, I think that is about to change. Volume is drying up, indicating the range traders are growing exhausted of the month long consolidation. I expect a large breakout soon, probably next week…take speculations like this with a grain of salt, anything can happen. </p><p>That said, there are several stocks I am monitoring for entry, listed below. They must meet the specific requirements for me to buy. If you are unaware of what SEPA is, continue reading. </p><p>Before that, if you missed any of these posts from the week, check them out in your free time:</p><ul><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-bull-market-is-not-over?r=4z8lgl\">The Bull Market is NOT Over</a></strong></em></p></li><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-219790567?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Oil Price Expectations</a></strong></em></p></li><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-219242822?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Gold &amp; Silver Re-accumulation Strategy</a></strong></em></p></li><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-217764079?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Why Banks Are The Best Investment Right Now</a> </strong></em></p><p></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p></li></ul><h4>SEPA - Specific Entry Point Analysis</h4><p>SEPA is a stock entry method developed by Mark Minervini, 2-time U.S. Investing champion. I have used this method for a few years now and can attest to its effectiveness. There are several additional rules (relative strength, volume, price range to highs, earnings, etc.). But for a visual explanation, look at each scenario and the color coded matching explanation. Personally, I target breakouts in an attempt to ride a longer term trend. Right now, with S&amp;P 500 futures as an example, I continue to do nothing, because investing during a consolidation (yellow) would be our capital <strong>not working </strong>for us and<strong> increased risk</strong>. I want price to get above $7043 to consider an entry.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png\" width=\"1259\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1259,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:251277,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/189359735?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mYtM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0744f571-64cb-4136-a23a-771e699e6ce1_1259x819.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">I am only interested in investing, when and if, price action follows the green scenario. ONLY THAT SCENARIO. Otherwise, I continue to protect capital. </figcaption></figure></div><p>I apply the same process, along with other fundamental &amp; price analysis to individual stocks. Below are SEPA entries, and analysis, on stocks I am seeking re-entries for. </p><p><strong>Please like ❤️ and re-stack or share this post. This is how we combat AI slop! </strong></p><p>Note: I only provide stocks I am genuinely interested in. I wont review a ticker not worth our time.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Pan American Silver (PAAS)</strong>, secured a 30.6% profit before </p></li><li><p><strong>Ero Copper Corp (ERO)</strong>, secured a 35.4% profit before</p></li><li><p><strong>Clear Secure (YOU)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Nvidia (NVDA)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Alibaba (BABA)</strong>, secured a 22.2% profit before</p></li><li><p><strong>Cathay General Bancorp (CATY)</strong>, currently in profit - add to position</p></li><li><p><strong>Exxon Mobil (XOM)</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Rigettti (RGTI)</strong>, secured a 54.3% profit before</p></li><li><p><strong>Opendoor Technologies (OPEN) </strong></p></li></ul>",
